<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Firebase Auth &amp; Firestore on iOS UIKit Course</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/</link><description>Recent content in Firebase Auth &amp; Firestore on iOS UIKit Course</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>12.1. App 12 with Firebase</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.1.-app-12-with-firebase/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.1.-app-12-with-firebase/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="121-app-12-with-firebase"&gt;12.1. App 12 with Firebase&lt;a class="anchor" href="#121-app-12-with-firebase"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this module, we will build App 12, which will be a contacts list app using,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firebase Authentication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firebase Firestore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="app12-my-contacts-app"&gt;App12: My Contacts app&lt;a class="anchor" href="#app12-my-contacts-app"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The overall goal is to build an app like the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="/gitbook-assets/12.one (1).gif" alt=""&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The app has the following features:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The user can create an account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The user can sign in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The user can store their contacts in a database.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They can log out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each authenticated user will have a separate contacts list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="setting-up-your-firebase-project-in-firebases-console"&gt;Setting up your Firebase project in Firebase&amp;rsquo;s Console&lt;a class="anchor" href="#setting-up-your-firebase-project-in-firebases-console"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please set up your own Firebase project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create your own App12 in Xcode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add your app to Firebase project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download and add the GoogleService-Info.plist to your Xcode project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure Firebase in AppDelegate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patch up Firebase libraries, Auth, Firestore, FirestoreSwift, and Storage using Swift Package manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Then use the code provided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Otherwise, you cannot see what is happening in Firebase.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>12.2. Setting up the Main Screen View</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.2.-setting-up-the-main-screen-view/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.2.-setting-up-the-main-screen-view/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="122-setting-up-the-main-screen-view"&gt;12.2. Setting up the Main Screen View&lt;a class="anchor" href="#122-setting-up-the-main-screen-view"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this Project, we will keep the codes as modular as possible. So, let&amp;rsquo;s create a new Group called &amp;lsquo;Main Screen.&amp;rsquo; Put ViewController.swift file inside &amp;lsquo;Main Screen.&amp;rsquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then we create a new Group called &amp;lsquo;Views&amp;rsquo; inside &amp;lsquo;Main Screen.&amp;rsquo; Add a new file named MainScreenView.swift inside &amp;lsquo;Views.&amp;rsquo; The structure looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/gitbook-assets/Screenshot%202023-06-02%20at%202.39.45%20PM.png" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="mainscreenviewswift"&gt;MainScreenView.swift&lt;a class="anchor" href="#mainscreenviewswift"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then open MainScreenView.swift, and the following code there:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12.3. Setting up the ViewController with TableView</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.3.-setting-up-the-viewcontroller-with-tableview/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.3.-setting-up-the-viewcontroller-with-tableview/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="123-setting-up-the-viewcontroller-with-tableview"&gt;12.3. Setting up the ViewController with TableView&lt;a class="anchor" href="#123-setting-up-the-viewcontroller-with-tableview"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now we will patch up the view to the controller. Let&amp;rsquo;s open up &lt;code&gt;MainScreen -&amp;gt; ViewController.swift&lt;/code&gt; file, and add the following code there:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// ViewController.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// App12&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 6/1/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ViewController&lt;/span&gt;: UIViewController {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; mainScreen = MainScreenView()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;loadView&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; view = mainScreen
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;viewDidLoad&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;.viewDidLoad()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; title = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;My Contacts&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; Make the titles look large...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; navigationController?.navigationBar.prefersLargeTitles = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; Put the floating button above all the views...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; view.bringSubviewToFront(mainScreen.floatingButtonAddContact)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;{% endcode %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12.4. Authentication State Handler</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.4.-authentication-state-handler/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.4.-authentication-state-handler/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="124-authentication-state-handler"&gt;12.4. Authentication State Handler&lt;a class="anchor" href="#124-authentication-state-handler"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, it&amp;rsquo;s time to set up the authentication for the app. We will use the right navigation bar buttons to manage the sign-in, register, and logout operations. Before we set up those buttons, let&amp;rsquo;s write the logic to handle the authentication states in the app. Let&amp;rsquo;s open ViewCOntroller.swift file and write the following code there:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// ViewController.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// App12&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 6/1/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;FirebaseAuth&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ViewController&lt;/span&gt;: UIViewController {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; handleAuth: AuthStateDidChangeListenerHandle?
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; currentUser:FirebaseAuth.User?
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;loadView&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; view = mainScreen
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;viewWillAppear&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt; animated: Bool) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;.viewWillAppear(animated)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; handling if the Authentication state is changed (sign in, sign out, register)...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; handleAuth = Auth.auth().addStateDidChangeListener{ auth, user &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; user == &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; not signed in...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; the user is signed in...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;viewDidLoad&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;.viewDidLoad()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;viewWillDisappear&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt; animated: Bool) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;.viewWillDisappear(animated)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; Auth.auth().removeStateDidChangeListener(handleAuth!)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;{% endcode %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12.6. Firestore Structure for Storing Contacts</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.6.-firestore-structure-for-storing-contacts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.6.-firestore-structure-for-storing-contacts/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="126-firestore-structure-for-storing-contacts"&gt;12.6. Firestore Structure for Storing Contacts&lt;a class="anchor" href="#126-firestore-structure-for-storing-contacts"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At this point, our authentication service is working great. Now have to design our Firestore structure to accommodate a contacts list for each user.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, we can design the Firestore database with the following structure:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root Document
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;users (collection)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;user1 (document)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;contacts (collection)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;contact1 (document)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;contact2 (document)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;contact3 (document)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;hellip;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;user2 (document)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;user3 (document)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;hellip;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have multiple users, and each user has a list of contacts. Hence, in the above structure:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12.7. Adding a New Contact</title><link>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.7.-adding-a-new-contact/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/07-cloud-integrations-and-maps/firebase-auth-and-firestore/12.7.-adding-a-new-contact/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="127-adding-a-new-contact"&gt;12.7. Adding a New Contact&lt;a class="anchor" href="#127-adding-a-new-contact"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s focus on building the functionalities to add a new contact for a signed-in user in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s add a new group in the file navigator, &amp;lsquo;Add Contact Screen.&amp;rsquo; Create a file named &amp;lsquo;AddContactViewController.swift&amp;rsquo; inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a sub-group of &amp;lsquo;Add Contact Screen&amp;rsquo; named &amp;lsquo;Views&amp;rsquo; and create &amp;lsquo;AddContactView.swift&amp;rsquo; file inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/gitbook-assets/Screenshot%202023-06-02%20at%2011.30.10%20PM%20%281%29.png" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="addcontactviewswift"&gt;AddContactView.swift&lt;a class="anchor" href="#addcontactviewswift"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
